  "label": "User projected onto the text overlay",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'the future of the democratic party' as the central interpretive anchor of the meme. The text explicitly frames the visual scene (the women at the podium) as representing the party's future, inviting the user to interpret the image through this lens. There are no explicit deictic pronouns like 'you' or 'me', but the text functions as a direct address to the viewer, demanding that they see the visual material as embodying the future of the Democratic Party. The projection is onto the text_chunk, which acts as the conceptual and semantic focal point.",
